[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:43. Hurry Up]
[00:01.380]Lesson 43|第43课
[00:03.400]Can you make the tea, John?|你能泡茶吗，约翰？
[00:05.995]Yes, of course I can, Mary.|是的，我当然可以，玛丽。
[00:09.170]Is there any water in this kettle?|这个水壶里有水吗？
[00:12.660]Yes, there is.|是的，有。
[00:14.920]Where's the tea, dear?|茶叶在哪里，亲爱的？
[00:17.305]It's over there,|就在那边，
[00:19.300]behind the teapot.|在茶壶后面。
[00:21.975]Can you see it?|你能看到吗？
[00:24.360]I can see the teapot,|我能看到茶壶，
[00:26.345]but I can't see the tea.|但我没看到茶叶。
[00:28.750]There it is.|就在那儿。
[00:31.130]It's in front of you.|就在你前面。
[00:32.925]Ah, yes, I can see it now.|啊，是的，我现在看到了。
[00:36.760]Where are the teacups?|茶杯在哪里？
[00:39.695]There are some in the cupboard.|碗柜里有一些。
[00:42.555]Can you find them?|你能找到它们吗？
[00:44.945]Yes.|是的。
[00:46.045]Here they are.|它们在这里。
[00:47.760]Hurry up, John!|快点，约翰！
[00:50.085]The kettle's boiling.|水壶里的水开了。